WEBVTT

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:40.530
Aion...

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:47.080
It's been a long time, Chrono.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.130
How many decades has it been?

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.920
A voice? Chrono, is that bird talking?

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.130
It's not a bird.

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:59.340
That's Aion. He's a devil too.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:02.300
You talk like we're strangers.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.180
We're friends.

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:06.770
Are we not both Sinners?

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:11.690
I won't go along with you any longer.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:14.110
Even if I said that I'd
give you back your horns?

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:21.200
You know, I'd like to
proceed to the next step soon.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:24.450
There's no way that
you've forgotten our dream, right?

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:31.960
Young Miss, it was
good of you to awaken Chrono.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.000
As a reward, I'll tell you.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.920
For us devils,
a horn is the source of our power,

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.180
an organ that absorbs the astral.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:43.720
Although, I'm the one that broke his off.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:51.230
Thanks to that, he has become an outcast
who can't use his power for very long.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.320
Come with me, Chrono.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.530
If you come with me,
I'll give back your horns.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:02.870
Forget about the past,
and let's have fun again.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:07.830
The glorious you that
killed over one hundred million

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:10.330
of our own kind in Pandemonium...

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.370
I want to see him one more time.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.430
No.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.480
I've found a little something,

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.940
something that I wasn't
able to see from the skies.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.950
If I follow you,

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.860
then everything that I am
right now will be for nothing!

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:47.950
So what should I do
with those horns, then?

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.660
You can have them.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.790
I thought you'd say that.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:00.920
Actually, I've already
given them to someone else.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:07.430
Young Miss,
your younger brother is wonderful.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.150
Don't you think it's unfair?

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.280
Over here.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.910
Thanks to you,

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:37.460
there are people who have been healed of
their illnesses, and now run around, healthy.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:43.050
Yet you live your life in fear of
your next fit, which might come at any time.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:52.220
Don't you want power?

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:11.290
If so, accept these.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:15.750
They're the horns of a devil that killed
one hundred million of his own kind.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.920
What did you do to Joshua?!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.920
Aion! You couldn't have!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:28.300
Your friend is interesting,
in possession of a very strong fact.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:31.510
He looks like he will become
a great addition to our forces.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:34.270
Answer me! What did you do to Joshua?!

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:44.570
Find out for yourself.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:45.530
Wait!

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:47.320
Let's hurry!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.260
They really are an
interesting brother and sister.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:12.180
Just what are you plotting?

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.890
What is this?!

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.770
This is my original form.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:23.940
The form I've taken up until now
suppresses my consumption of astral.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:26.150
We're going to go quickly.
Joshua is in danger!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.940
Joshua! Is something the matter?

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:07.780
Joshua!

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:09.190
Open up, Joshua!

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:12.740
Joshua, what's wrong? Answer us!

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.620
Joshua!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.520
You'll get better soon.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.200
You'll be leaving in one week.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.000
Until then, it would be best
to take it easy and recuperate.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:08.210
If I go, will I be able to become strong?

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:11.880
I can't say that for sure. It will take time.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.840
You need a long period of special training.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:18.850
Will I be able to become strong?

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:21.390
Don't you want power?

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:24.480
You are one of the chosen.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:29.320
Hey, Joshua, what's happening?

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.570
Come on, answer me.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.490
He's disgusting.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.200
What are those horns?

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.790
What kind of sickness is this?

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:44.420
Billy!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.500
That's mean, Billy.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:52.920
I don't have fits like these
because I like them, but still...

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.760
Even still...Even still...

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:06.060
Why are you looking at me like that, Billy?

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:16.990
What is he?!

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.450
He's a monster! He's a monster!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.410
I'm going to be killed! Save me! Someone!

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:25.290
Stop it! Stop the noise!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:30.420
Please stop it! Please stop it!

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.400
The noise has gone away.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.320
I see!

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.820
All I have to do is stop it.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.990
It's that simple.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:15.630
Joshua!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.090
Wait, Rosette!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:27.430
Seira! Nelly!

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:29.900
Rosette! Where have you been?

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:32.020
Where's Joshua?! What's happened?

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:35.530
Well, Joshua has... Joshua has...

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.240
What's happened to Joshua?

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:38.740
Don't go!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.340
Everyone...

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.060
What's wrong?

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:12.060
Why are you all stiff?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.650
Hey, Seira!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:18.190
What is this? What's going on?!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.700
Answer me!

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:25.280
Joshua...

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.790
Hey, Rosette.

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:38.420
Joshua, what's going on? No one's moving.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.420
They've all stopped moving!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:45.550
It's all right, Rosette. I stopped them.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:48.930
The noise coming
from everyone was horrible.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:51.390
That's why I had them stop.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:54.770
Once I did, I finally felt refreshed.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:59.280
But you know, my body feels really great.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:03.110
It felt like power was rushing
into me when I stopped everyone.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:06.990
I think I've gotten incredibly strong.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.580
Rosette, it's all right now.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.410
You don't have to
become a doctor or anything.

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:16.080
Stop it. This is strange.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:20.550
This...This isn't like you,Joshua!

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:31.350
What did I just say?

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:35.730
Joshua...

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:41.400
Stop it!

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:46.990
Please stop it! Please stop this noise!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.080
Joshua!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.830
Run, Rosette!

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:56.670
I...I'll end up stopping you too!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:13.020
Joshua...

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.110
Chrono!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:33.500
Chrono, what's happening to everything?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:37.580
The people and the grass and the trees...

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.170
...they're all getting stiff.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:44.590
Time is being frozen. It's a kind of barrier.

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:49.300
If he continues to run wild
like this, even Joshua won't be safe!

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.430
No! Let me go!

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.350
I'm going to where Joshua is!

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:56.270
You can't!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:59.480
Then stop him!
Those are your horns, right?!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.190
Can't you do something about this?!

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:10.280
This is the price for earlier.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:13.410
Because I don't have
enough astral, I can't even heal myself.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:18.670
For a devil,
running out of astral means death.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:38.730
Hey, what should we do?

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.770
What should we do?!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:47.400
Without my horns or a contractor,
right now, I have no power.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.660
A contractor?

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:57.750
Hey, if you had one,
could you save Joshua?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:58.660
Well...

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.460
Tell me!

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.170
Come on, please, tell me!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.130
A contract is normally
conducted through a spell cast on a devil

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:15.140
that answers
the summons of a devil summoner.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:19.430
By directly receiving
a certain something from the human,

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:21.140
they can temporarily use their abilities

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:24.060
without using their horn
as a medium for their power.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:29.440
That cost is paid with your time alive,

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.660
in other words, the life span of your soul.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:38.160
Let's think of another method.
We can still make it.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:39.290
But...

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.160
You'd suffer pain for your entire life!

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:44.750
And that life would only be
a fraction of its normal length!

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:53.220
Would you really be
all right with a life like that?!

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:02.350
I said it before.

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:05.020
That I was going to protect Joshua.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:09.360
I thought I knew
everything about him, but...

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.570
...it looks like I was actually wrong.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:15.240
You don't have to become a doctor.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:18.450
He didn't like getting sympathy, did he?

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.710
I don't want it to end like this.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:26.710
That's why I have to tell him.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:31.420
Tell him,
"We're going to become explorers, right?"

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:35.260
That, "We're going to go to
places no one else has ever been to."

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:41.350
And, "You're going to
write those records in a book!"

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.770
This is for Joshua's sake, Chrono!

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.230
I want to save him, no matter what!

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:49.860
That's why.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.610
That's why...

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:55.740
Please... Our dreams...

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.120
You come with us too.

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:01.700
Let's go together, the three of us.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:15.590
I understand.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:20.510
I will make a contract
with you, Rosette Christopher.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:31.690
This is the symbol of our contract,

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:34.360
a watch that ticks off your time alive.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:55.050
My time is still moving.

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:16.110
What would have become of us after that,
if Minister Remington hadn't shown up?

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:20.160
In the end, we wouldn't have
even been able to go looking for Joshua,

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.540
and my lifespan may
have already been used up.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:27.210
Even still, the time we have left is short.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:30.290
Even to this day, there are times when
I wonder if this really was for the best.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:32.290
This <i>was</i> for the best!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:34.710
Rosette...

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:37.130
Being indecisive won't change anything.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:41.640
If it'll bring back Joshua,
and everyone's time, then I...

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.510
You can't!

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:46.310
Please care more about yourself, Rosette!

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:49.520
Don't try too hard. We're here too!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.120
How is he?

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:10.960
He is calm today.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.000
I see.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:15.050
Here are the coffee beans you asked for.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:17.050
Don't ask me to go
shopping for you when I go out.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.010
Thank you very much.

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:23.850
Thanks to you, I was able to stay
by Lord Joshua's side this whole time.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:37.650
Joshua...

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.570
Hey, Aion.

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:45.700
We found another apostle in Texas.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.370
Genai is heading there to secure it.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:51.000
How many are left?

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.250
One more.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:56.460
The apostle of Charity that
your older sister has with her.

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.840
Well, we'll take our time doing this.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:01.550
If you're talking about
my big sister, she's right here.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.640
If anything happens,
let me know right away.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.600
Yes, Sir.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:12.390
Are you going already?

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:14.730
The humans won't let me rest, you know.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.770
I'll see you later.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:17.730
Right.

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:20.780
Big sister...

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.200
Yes?

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.160
Hey, when do you want to go?

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:33.620
We made a promise to go
see the Astral Line, didn't we?

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:43.300
I'll say this plainly.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:50.100
Around the world, in all of
the places where the word of God is recited,

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:55.060
what this person has done
will also be spoken of as faith.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:02.780
Right, Mary of Magdalene?
